uffer. A value of 512 produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer as wide as the tile itself. Larger values produce fewer rendering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artifacts near tile edges and slower performance. The default value is 128."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionmaximumzoomlevel","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the maximum zoom level at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. A greater value produces greater detail at high"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"zoom levels. The default value is 18."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionminimumzoomlevel","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object containing an integer; specifies the minimum zoom level at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which to create vector tiles. The default value is 0.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape/shapeWithData:encoding:error:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"text":" object initialized with the given data interpreted as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string containing a GeoJSON object.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape\/shapewithdata:encoding:error:","type":"topic","title":"shapeWithData:encoding:error:","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/shapeWithData:encoding:error:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"shapeWithData:encoding:error:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionsimplificationtolerance","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a double; specifies the Douglas-Peucker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simplification tolerance. A greater value produces simpler geometries and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improves performance. The default value is 0.375."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre